# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's System Details screen$
# (pkg/screens/systemdetails), inferred from origin/main$
# (unreleased), read from a simulated host by the real reader$
# (pkg/engine/details). It only reads: no plan, no y/N, no$
# journal. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's.$
$
