# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, as the VM of 2026-10-21$
# (vmtest.md §8.5): kernel 6.12.113+deb13-cloud-amd64, sudo. The$
# report, Refresh and Return. Last Login is lslogins' newest$
# login for root and each user (decision 3 (a)), the same answer$
# as a user and as root, an account with none answering blanks$
# (vm-runs/s1/02-login.log).$
